# BG3 font tile codes (2bpp font at file 0x40000, 256 tiles; VRAM tile = $280 + code on the title/HUD screens).
# Used raw by the stage-name records (file 0x1070) and as the low byte of the HUD tilemap words (file 0x2B400).
# Read off the font and cross-checked against the format-A byte map at 0x28200 (tests/test_tables.py).
# F0-FB hold pre-composed voiced kana; F7, FA, FB are unread (guess: っ, then the FINAL stage name's last two).
